  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每局沿分支轨道逐层推进，穿过首领、特殊事件和不断抬高的风险。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Battle Train brings classic roguelite design to the tracks with fast-paced duels, branching paths, and floor-based progression packed with bosses, special events, and escalating stakes.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "铺设轨道连接敌方据点后开火，特殊轨道、路障和炸弹会直接改变线路攻防。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Connect your tracks to your opponents’ outposts and blast them before they do the same to you. Every piece of track matters: special rails boost your trains, barricades slow down enemies, and bombs can swing the tide with a single move.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "卡牌奖励和升级逐回合塑造策略，列车还能更换零件获得属性、被动、矿物或干扰能力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Adapt your playstyle in every run and then push it further, with evolving card rewards and powerful upgrades that shape your strategy turn by turn. Your train is a full-blown war machine built from swappable parts, each offering unique stat boosts, passive effects, mineral gains, or disruptive abilities.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1708950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
